OL,3,ABus crash on Egypt's Red Sea coast
OL,4,Akills 16
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 16 people have been killed in
OL,7,Fa bus crash in eastern Egypt, the
OL,8,Fcountry's health ministry has said.
OL,10,FAnother 28 people were injured on the
OL,11,Froad between Red Sea towns of Dahab and
OL,12,FNuweiba in the South Sinai governorate
OL,13,Fon Wednesday morning.
OL,15,FAs many as 20 ambulances were sent to
OL,16,Fthe scene of the accident to provide
OL,17,Ffirst aid and evacuate the injured, the
OL,18,Fministry said. The cause of the crash
OL,19,Fremains unknown.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
